  "description": "Repairs r-str-ado-act/str-memo-chunks: Field.FieldSize was invoked as a method (the call kind) and refused on all snapshot calls, so it is unknown whether FieldSize is a snapshot limit or was a probe-choice limit. FieldSize is now read with a property get. On a snapshot of SELECT ID, T, M FROM S ORDER BY ID (read-only copy of r-str-ado-act-str-accdb) with Fields(\"T\") and Fields(\"M\") retained, for rows 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 9, 10 and 11 (FindFirst by ID, NoMatch read): M.FieldSize (property get, DBEngine.Errors read right after) and M.GetChunk at (0, 16), (7999, 5), (8000, 4), (0, 0) and (1000000, 4); then FieldSize (property get) and GetChunk(0, 4) of the Text field T of row 3. Asks the reported sizes, returned tags and byte lengths, and errors.",
